### AI security boundaries

The AI must never:

- Sign transactions.
- Fund escrows.
- Approve fulfilment.
- Release funds.
- Refund funds.
- Access private keys.
- Independently execute financial actions.
- Override wallet authorisation.
- Claim a transaction succeeded without verified transaction results.

Gemini drafts and checks agreements.

The user authorises transactions.

Trustless Work executes the escrow flow.

Stellar provides the authoritative on-chain records.

Server-side validation must remain in place. A system prompt alone is not a security boundary.

